 set and tackle tasks at your own pace. Experiment, adjust, and keep building. Through intelligence, resilience &amp; smart engineering, you will carve order from chaos and forge humanity\u2019s path to the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/extras/e76533230175297dfd6c04448b56e2aa.poster.avif?t=1768317598\" width=500 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/extras/e76533230175297dfd6c04448b56e2aa.webm?t=1768317598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/extras/e76533230175297dfd6c04448b56e2aa.mp4?t=1768317598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["ByteRockers' Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/25c7e9a01a7752bbfac2f2be7348da1867e13c11/header.jpg?t=1768317598","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright ByteRockers' Games GmbH & Co. KG. All rights reserved. ByteRockers Games is a trademark registered in Germany and the USA.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3144430/1531708495/bc7144eef076b263b71670fa42b9efecad6c8c81/1752238374/dash_av1.mpd?t=1752243752","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3144430/1531708495/bc7144eef076b263b71670fa42b9efecad6c8c81/1752238374/dash_h264.mpd?t=1752243752","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3144430/1531708495/bc7144eef076b263b71670fa42b9efecad6c8c81/1752238374/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1752243752","id":257130979,"name":"Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257130979/5